{
  "speakers": {
    "npc": {
      "name": {
        "type": "expression",
        "expression": "q.npc.name"
      },
      "face": "q.npc.face();"
    },
    "player": {
      "face": "q.player.face();",
      "name": {
        "type": "expression",
        "expression": "q.player.username"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "welcome_1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Welcome to Pewter City! The Stone Gray City!"
      ],
      "input": "q.dialogue.set_page('welcome_2');"
    },
    {
      "id": "welcome_2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "What would you like to learn about?"
      ],
      "input": {
        "type": "option",
        "vertical": true,
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "Gym",
            "value": "gym",
            "action": [
              "q.dialogue.set_page('gym_1');"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Museum",
            "value": "museum",
            "action": [
              "q.dialogue.set_page('museum_1');"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Pewter Crunchies",
            "value": "crunchies",
            "action": [
              "q.dialogue.set_page('crunchies_1');"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Cerulean City",
            "value": "map",
            "action": [
              "t.npc_data = q.player.get_npc_data(q.npc); t.next_page = t.npc_data.map_gave == 1 ? 'map_gave' : 'map_1'; q.dialogue.set_page(t.next_page)"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Nothing",
            "value": "nothing",
            "action": [
              "q.dialogue.set_page('quitter');"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "map_1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Heading to Cerulean City? Here, take this MAP!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.run_command('loot give ' + q.player.username() + ' loot ccs:maps/cerulean');",
        "q.player.play_sound_on_server('ccs:item_get','blocks');",
        "q.player.set_npc_variable(q.npc, 'map_gave', 1);",
        "q.dialogue.close();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "map_gave",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Use that MAP to find your way to Cerulean City! Travel safe!"
      ],
      "input": "q.dialogue.close();"
    },
    {
      "id": "gym_1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Hiya! You're here to challenge the Gym, aren't you? BROCK is looking for new challengers!"
      ],
      "input": "q.dialogue.set_page('gym_2');"
    },
    {
      "id": "gym_2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "His Pokémon are all hard as rock and have true- grit determination! That's right! His Pokémon are all Rock types!"
      ],
      "input": "q.dialogue.close();"
    },
    {
      "id": "museum_1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "There is a museum here. I heard someone suspicious is hanging around inside."
      ],
      "input": "q.dialogue.set_page('museum_2');"
    },
    {
      "id": "museum_2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "They also feature a rare chunk of amber recovered from the mines!"
      ],
      "input": "q.dialogue.close();"
    },
    {
      "id": "crunchies_1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "You gotta try our local speciality Pewter Crunchies! They are rugged, bumpy and brown. Hard to stop eating after just one."
      ],
      "input": "q.dialogue.set_page('crunchies_2');"
    },
    {
      "id": "crunchies_2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Oh, and you're probably going to want some tea after eating them. Pewter Crunchies can make you thirsty."
      ],
      "input": "q.dialogue.set_page('crunchies_3');"
    },
    {
      "id": "crunchies_3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "There really is nothing like a hot cup of tea to go with your Pewter Crunchies!"
      ],
      "input": "q.dialogue.close();"
    },
    {
      "id": "quitter",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "If you have the right stuff, go take on BROCK!"
      ],
      "input": "q.dialogue.close();",
      "escapeAction": "q.dialogue.close();"
    }
  ]
}